      "rev_n_10_78b9f3_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_10_78b9f3_1",
        "node_id": "n_10_78b9f3",
        "thought_text": "The error in the code is due to incorrect handling of the base cases in the dynamic programming approach. The logic for updating dp[i][j] when (n - length) % 2 == 0 is correct, but the base cases for length = 1 and length = 2 need to be handled separately to avoid index out of range errors.",
